# IMDb Movie Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview
An interactive IMDb Movie Analytics Dashboard developed using Python, Streamlit, Pandas, and Plotly.

## Features
- Total Movies, Average IMDb Rating, Highest Rating, and Total Votes
- Movies by Genre visualization
- IMDb Rating Distribution
- Rating vs Number of Votes analysis
- Top 10 Movies by Worldwide Gross
- Interactive Movie Explorer
- Movie Search using Streamlit Forms and Session State
- CSV Dataset Upload and Persistent Local Storage

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Streamlit
- Pandas
- Plotly

## Installation

Install the required dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run the Application

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

Upload the IMDb CSV dataset through the sidebar when running the application for the first time.

## Dataset
IMDb Top 250 Movies dataset containing movie titles, ratings, votes, genres, countries, and worldwide gross collection.

